(7544822, 1207658, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club <br/> <br/>An appealing image that meets the challenge well<br/> <br/>Hello Mariano and welcome to DPC with your maiden entry, and what a maiden! I like the costume and her make up, especially the fangs! Technically is not bad at all but I do have a couple of things to say. The lighting is good but she is too close to the background, you want it uniformly black and sufficiently soft focused to get rid of all the creases. Whilst camera shake is not evident I would suggest 1/60s as a minimum speed if it was hand held but it is acceptable if you used a tripod. Anyway, great start Mariano we look forward to more from you</td>', 'Hello from the critique club  An appealing image that meets the challenge well Hello Mariano and welcome to DPC with your maiden entry, and what a maiden! I like the costume and her make up, especially the fangs! Technically is not bad at all but I do have a couple of things to say. The lighting is good but she is too close to the background, you want it uniformly black and sufficiently soft focused to get rid of all the creases. Whilst camera shake is not evident I would suggest 1/60s as a minimum speed if it was hand held but it is acceptable if you used a tripod. Anyway, great start Mariano we look forward to more from you', '2017-11-15 18:09:22.000000', NULL, 0),
